3. Establishment of Minimum Wages Board. (1) As soon as may be after the commencement of this Act, the Government shall establish a Minimum Wages Board consisting of the following members to be appointed by it, namely:
(a) Chairman of the Board;
(b) Director General Labour Welfare, Punjab;
(c) Mines Labour Welfare Commissioner, Punjab;
